# Partnerships in the Arts and the Humanities.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
The article states that the humanities are vital to the education of every American, and our programs in the humanities need at least as much improvement and support as our programs in the sciences. The importance of teaching the humanities and teaching them well are discussed. Special partnership programs around the country are briefly described. (CT)

